# Extra agent-facing paths for dot-claude/hooks/agent-docs-guard.sh.
# One extended-regex per line, matched against the edited file's path.
#
# Everything under dot-claude/skills/ is a skill's own source. The guard
# recognises SKILL.md by name already; this catches the rest of a skill
# directory — REFERENCE.md, GLOSSARY.md, templates, helper scripts — which is
# agent-facing because of where it sits, not what it is called.
(^|/)dot-claude/skills/
